      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greenwood%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The original courthouse, a log structure, was replaced in 1865 by a frame building that later burned.",
